                <pb facs="1029" n="913" sameAs="frus:frus1923v01/pg913"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">839.00/2760: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Commissioner in the Dominican Republic</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Welles</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-11-12T16:00:00-05:00"><hi rendition="#italic">November 12,
                                1923—4 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>6. Your 62, November 9, 9 a.m., last paragraph.</p>
                <p>Department has no objection to the modification of Article 2 of the Plan of
                    Evacuation in the manner suggested by you. The Department takes this opportunity
                    to express its gratification for the agreement which you have been able to bring
                    about.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
